ces of evil are gathering and the darkest hour is just before the dawn...","poster_path":"/8s2h8JuPgtjWLmNOq1gk99rMaS.jpg","season_number":4,"vote_average":7.5},{"air_date":"2012-10-06","episode_count":13,"id":61395,"name":"Season 5","overview":"The epic fifth and final series of Merlin sees Camelot at the height of its golden age. With Queen Guinevere and the Knights of the Round Table at his side, Arthur has never felt stronger.\n\nBut even as Camelot flowers, the seeds of her destruction are being sown... As the forces of darkness gather, only Merlin stands between Arthur and a fate that has been written since the dawn of time...","poster_path":"/zj2KkDmnYIJxKDEainHmTFpf0xO.jpg","season_number":5,"vote_average":7.3}],"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Ended","tagline":"Magic is his destiny.","type":"Scripted","vote_average":7.83,"vote_count":1064,"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":228866,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Colin Morgan","original_name":"Colin Morgan","popularity":2.1257,"profile_path":"/jeSLhhfUIZR3UQGGhtYTk0J2I5.jpg","character":"Merlin","credit_id":"52578a60760ee36aaa674f44","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":289370,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Angel Coulby","original_name":"Angel Coulby","popularity":0.8156,"profile_path":"/6Hep6byLM9bNnRH3SBaApevbeVi.jpg","character":"Gwen","credit_id":"52578a61760ee36aaa674f62","order":1},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":154689,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Bradley James","original_name":"Bradley James","popularity":1.6367,"profile_path":"/djYjl9kE2VPSO3qLnC8Jo3aD8d2.jpg","character":"Arthur Pendragon","credit_id":"52578a61760ee36aaa674f58","order":2},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":150587,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Katie McGrath","original_name":"Katie McGrath","popularity":1.6789,"profile_path":"/cq9pc7qFRUKCrkXgsi5mJkb64U5.jpg","character":"Morgana","credit_id":"55891266925141525c000114","orde